<title>USA: AMEX closes averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closes averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 578.47, up 4.69.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up 11 cents.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 319 to 222.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 18,353,165 compared with 17,835,670 on Friday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EST/2130 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
